🏠 <b>Home</b>
/status — dashboard · /start view — open a screen

📈 <b>Metrics</b>
/metrics — overview
/cpu /mem /disk /net — one metric
/temp /battery — hardware
/top — heaviest processes
/digest — daily summary (auto-sent each morning)

🧩 <b>Services</b>
/services — units, processes, ports
/docker — containers
/http — endpoint checks (/http add url)
/ssl — certificate expiry (/ssl add host)
/ping host — TCP latency from this server

🔐 <b>Security</b>
/security — overview
/ssh — live sessions (disconnect buttons)
/ssh history — recent logins · /ssh fails — failed attempts
/firewall — open/close SSH port 22
/trusted — trusted SSH sources (/trust ip · /untrust ip)

⚙️ <b>Settings</b>
/settings — thresholds &amp; digest
/watching — manage everything watched
/services_scan /ports_scan — find candidates
(/services_add, /ports_add, /procs_add … still work typed)
/update — check for a new version
/clear_chat — wipe recent messages
--- keyboard ---
[🏠 Home] → ~1v|home
